#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
sc360se-gui — GTK4 frontend for the AULA SC360SE driver.

Talks to the device by spawning the `sc360se` CLI binary from this
directory (or from $PATH). Profile files use the same INI format the
C driver reads/writes, so CLI and GUI can share configs.
"""

